OL,3,GNEWSAThe Punjabi princess who fought
OL,4,Afor women's rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe surprising and contradictory life
OL,7,Fof a British Indian aristocrat who
OL,8,Fbecame a Suffragette, criticised the
OL,9,FBritish rule in India and was also the
OL,10,Fgoddaughter of Queen Victoria, is being
OL,11,Fexplored in an exhibition at Kensington
OL,12,FPalace.
OL,14,FPrincess Sophia Duleep Singh was born
OL,15,Fon 8 August 1876 in Belgravia, west
OL,16,FLondon and spent her whole life in the
OL,17,Fcapital while her other relatives moved
OL,18,Fto Europe or returned to India.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
