OL,3,GNEWSAThe Punjabi princess who fought
OL,4,Afor women's rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, 150 years after her birth, her
OL,7,Flife is being told through photographs,
OL,8,Fpersonal possessions, letters and
OL,9,Fhistorical documents and the people who
OL,10,Finfluenced her political beliefs and
OL,11,Fvalues.
OL,13,FAfter the deaths of his father and
OL,14,Fbrother, Duleep Singh became ruler of
OL,15,Fthe kingdom at the age of five, but was
OL,16,Fremoved from the throne after Britain
OL,17,Fannexed the Punjab in 1849.
